main.content:
{{Straw Hat Pirates Tabs Top}}

The '''Straw Hat Pirates''', also known as the '''Mugiwara Pirates''', '''Straw Hat Crew''' or  simply the '''Straw Hats''', are an extremely infamous and powerful [[pirate]] crew under the captaincy of [[Monkey D. Luffy]] that originated from the [[East Blue]].

First referred to with this moniker by [[Smoker]] in [[Arabasta Kingdom|Arabasta]],{{Qref|name=Name|chap=212|page=18|ep=127|Smoker reveals to the Government that the Straw Hats defeated the Baroque Works.}} the crew made its way through the first half of the [[Grand Line]] within a year of Luffy beginning his pirating career, rapidly becoming more infamous and attracting powerful enemies and allies alike. Luffy, as well as his right hand man, [[Roronoa Zoro]], were both recognized as [[Super Rookie]]s with bounties of over {{B}}100,000,000. However, following a total defeat in the aftermath of the [[Celestial Dragon Hit-and-Run Incident]], the crew was separated by [[Bartholomew Kuma]] and Luffy made the decision to have them train separately for two years to increase their strength for the [[New World]].{{Qref|chap=512|chap2=597|ep=404|ep2=516|Straw Hats training during the point between the two eras.}} The crew successfully reunited after this time and reached the New World, where they have continued in exploits sending shockwaves throughout the world. As founding members of the [[Ninja-Pirate-Mink-Samurai Alliance]], they played a central role in the [[Raid on Onigashima|overthrow]] of [[Kaidou]] and [[Charlotte Linlin|Big Mom]] of the [[Four Emperors]], and following this Luffy was recognized as one of the Emperors.{{Qref|name=emperor|chap=1053|page=17|ep=1080|Luffy became recognized as one of the Four Emperors.}}

Of their many allies, the Straw Hats are most prominently tied to the [[Straw Hat Grand Fleet]] whose members officially professed their service to Luffy during the [[Dressrosa Arc]], giving the crew over 5600 subordinates at their command if necessary.{{Qref|chap=800|page=8-12|ep=745|The Straw Hat Grand Fleet is formed.}} Each Straw Hat member under Luffy is officially recognized as a Senior [[Officer]] of the Grand Fleet.{{Qref|chap=1058|page=3-5|ep=1086|The Straw Hat Pirates' bounties post-Wano Country.}}

The crew sailed on the [[Going Merry]],{{Qref|chap=41|ep=17|The Going Merry is given to Luffy and crew.}} their first official [[ship]], up until the [[Water 7 Arc]]. During the [[Post-Enies Lobby Arc]], [[Franky]] and [[Iceburg]] built them a new ship, which was named the [[Thousand Sunny]] by Iceburg.{{Qref|chap=436|ep=321|Iceburg reveals the Thousand Sunny to the Straw Hats.}}

Being led by main protagonist Luffy, they are the central protagonist group of the [[One Piece (Manga)|manga]] and [[One Piece (Anime)|anime]] ''One Piece''.

==Jolly Roger==
The [[Jolly Roger]] emblem is a cartoon-like depiction of traditional skull and crossbones, with the skull wearing Luffy's trademark straw hat. Due to Luffy's morbid drawing skills, Usopp was the one who drew the flag. In addition to being on their flag, the Jolly Roger has also been shown on the sails of the Going Merry and the Thousand Sunny.

