'''Zeus the Thundercloud''' is a [[Homies|thundercloud homie]] that is fused with [[Nami]]'s [[Art of Weather/Sorcery Clima-Tact/Zeus|Sorcery Clima-Tact]]. Before merging with the Clima-Tact, he was owned by [[Charlotte Linlin|Big Mom]], who would summon him from her left hand.{{Qref|name=intro}} Due to being made from a [[Soru Soru no Mi|soul fragment]] from Big Mom herself,{{Qref|name=c853|chap=853|page=2-3|ep=820|The origin of Zeus' soul is revealed.}} he is more powerful than most homies.

He was created by Big Mom in her youth, and served her into old age as one of her personal weapons alongside [[Prometheus]] and [[Napoleon]]. During the [[Straw Hat Pirates]]' escape from [[Totto Land]], Zeus was captured by the Straw Hats and forced to become Nami's servant.{{Qref|name=c890|chap=890|page=3, 10, 13-19|ep=863|ep2=865|The Sanji Retrieval Team fights against Big Mom and her homies.}} He lived inside her Sorcery Clima-Tact for a brief period until he was reclaimed by Big Mom in [[Wano Country]].{{Qref|name=c903}}{{Qref|name=c988|chap=988|page=7-15|ep=998|Nami and Zeus end their relationship.}} However, Big Mom later abandoned Zeus for good after he had struggled during the [[Raid on Onigashima]], replacing him with another homie named [[Hera]]. Big Mom attempted to remove her soul fragment from him,{{Qref|name=c1013|chap=1013|page=8-9|ep=1033|ep2=1034|Big Mom abandons Zeus.}} but he survived the ordeal by permanently fusing with Nami's Clima-Tact as a vessel.{{Qref|name=c1016|chap=1016|ep=1037|ep2=1038|Zeus reveals he has manifested in Nami's Clima-Tact.}} Zeus then joined Nami for good, this time as her partner.{{Qref|name=c1018}}

==Appearance==
Zeus normally appears as a large and light-colored cloud. When he caused a storm, he becomes dark and produces lightning crackles (pink in the anime while controlled by Big Mom, yellow in the anime while controlled by Nami).{{Qref|name=intro}} He also wears a striped red and blue (red and white in the anime) baseball cap with a yellow brim on his head.{{Qref|name=debut}} He usually has a carefree, sleepy expression, but can take on a more sinister appearance.{{Qref|name=c845|chap=845|page=3-4, 6|ep=809|The enraged army marches to battle.}} When he was initially described by [[Pound]], he lacked the baseball cap and most of his facial features.{{Qref|name=intro}} After being sliced in half by [[Brook]] and then drained of electricity by [[Nami]], Zeus's size was greatly reduced, enough to be held in one hand, and his face was enough to cover much of his body.{{Qref|chap=890|page=19|ep=865|Zeus greatly weakened and reduced.}} During the [[raid on Onigashima]], Zeus wore a blue kabuto helmet when he appeared alongside the other Straw Hats.{{Qref|name=c975|chap=975|page=4|ep=978}}

[[File:Zeus Clima-Tact.png|thumb|left|210px|Zeus as the Sorcery Clima-Tact.]]

After fusing with Nami's Sorcery Clima-Tact, Zeus's face can also appear in the middle of the Sorcery Clima-Tact's hilt, maintaining a dopey expression with blush marks. His face can also be transferred to the orange appendages at the end of the Clima-Tact whenever he causes them to grow, and he can also transfer his consciousness to the weather phenomena created by the Clima-Tact.{{Qref|name=c1016}} However, he mainly continues to assume his cloud form.{{Qref|name=c1041|chap=1041|page=12|ep=1068}}{{Qref|name=c1050|chap=1050|page=10}}{{-}}

