==Personality==
As one of her personal weapons, Zeus was very loyal to [[Charlotte Linlin|Big Mom]] and would come to her when she summoned him. Zeus also seemed to care about the safety of the citizens in [[Totto Land]] and hated to see them be tormented during Big Mom's rampages, but unlike his fellow homies, Zeus knew it was futile to try and reason with Big Mom when she is on one of her rampages.{{Qref|name=intro}}

However, despite his loyalty, Zeus shares her extreme gluttony and particularly enjoys eating thunderclouds. Zeus was willing to disobey direct orders from Big Mom as long as [[Nami]] kept feeding him [[Art of Weather/Sorcery Clima-Tact/Grow Up|thunderclouds]]. However, he is capable of reason and learning from his mistakes, as he became very angry when Nami tried feeding him again, though his anger made him open to attack.{{Qref|name=c890}} His loyalty to Big Mom does not come before valuing his own life, as when Big Mom ordered [[Hera]] to consume him, he begged to be allowed to leave in peace rather than surrender his soul power to Hera. He went as far as to assist Nami after feeling betrayed by Big Mom, and was willing to attack his master as a means of apology towards Nami for his earlier betrayal.{{Qref|name=c1013}}

He is also extremely carefree, as after he became Nami's servant, he readily accepted it and found it comfortable to be stored inside her Clima-Tact.

==Relationships==
===Straw Hat Pirates===
Because they interfered with Big Mom's interests, Zeus was initially an enemy of the [[Straw Hat Pirates#Sub-Groups|Sanji Retrieval Team]]. After [[Monkey D. Luffy|Luffy]] defeated [[Charlotte Cracker]], Zeus joined the assembled army to avenge him.{{Qref|name=c845}} When [[Brook]] tried to steal a copy of [[Charlotte Linlin|Big Mom]]'s [[poneglyph]]s, Zeus fought alongside Big Mom and the rest of her special homies and attacked him.{{Qref|name=c851|chap=851|page=8-9|ep=818|Big Mom and her special homie prepare to fight Brook.}} As the team was pursued by the Big Mom Pirates after they escaped [[Whole Cake Island]], Nami and Brook used Zeus against Big Mom by forcing him to discharge all his power. When Zeus was greatly weakened, Brook captured him and Nami coerced him into becoming her servant.{{Qref|name=c890}}

====Nami====
[[File:Nami and Zeus.png|thumb|295x295px|Nami holding Zeus.]]

After the Straw Hats escaped from Totto Land and Nami revealed that she keeps Zeus in her Clima-Tact, it was shown that Zeus apparently did not mind working for Nami.{{Qref|name=c903}} However, when Big Mom was later able to use her power to regain control of Zeus, Nami stated that their friendship was over.{{Qref|chap=988|page=13-14|ep=998}}

When Zeus was searching for Big Mom and saw Nami on the way, she lived up to her previous declaration and gave him the cold shoulder. However, when she saw how cruel Linlin was in discarding Zeus, she pitied him and tried to empower him with her clouds, only for Hera to intercept.{{Qref|name=c1013}} Thankfully, her actions allowed Zeus to survive by becoming one with her Clima-Tact, though when he saw she still did not forgive him for his earlier betrayal, he started making it up to her by helping her take down [[Ulti]] for good.{{Qref|chap=1016|ep=1037|ep2=1038}}

Nami was able to forgive Zeus for his earlier actions and though she declined Zeus' offer of him becoming her servant again, she made a better proposal of Zeus becoming her partner instead.{{Qref|name=c1018}} Nami has shown to be quite possessive over Zeus, showing a habit to hold and tightly grip him, becoming quite angry if he shows any form of disloyalty to her, causing Zeus to be quite afraid of her at times.

When [[Road]] had pledged himself as Nami's servant, Zeus states to him that he only ranks third in hierarchy of Nami's servants while placing himself first and Sanji in second.{{Qref|name=c1136|chap=1136|page=13|ep=1166}}

===Big Mom Pirates===
====Charlotte Linlin====
[[File:Big Mom's Special Homies.png|thumb|left|210px|Big Mom with her special homies.]]

Being a special [[Homies|homie]], Zeus is loyal to Big Mom and the [[Big Mom Pirates]].{{Qref|name=intro}} While Big Mom experiencing one of her food cravings, Zeus was shown caring for her well-being as well for Sweet City.{{Qref|name=c829|chap=829|page=9-10|ep=788|The special homies are concerned about Sweet City.}} Zeus was also shown to be vengeful towards those who upsets Big Mom.{{Qref|name=c845}} According to [[Charlotte Perospero]], Zeus is responsible for carrying Big Mom overseas.{{Qref|chap=879|page=7|ep=851|Perospero comments about Zeus' duty.}} Like most individuals, Zeus was shown to be afraid of Big Mom's rage.{{Qref|name=c848|chap=848|page=4-5|ep=813|Big Mom hears about the invasion to the Room of Treasure.}} When Big Mom and her children arrive at Wano Country, Big Mom openly stated her intentions to take Zeus back, and ultimately succeeds, threatening Zeus with death if he went easy on Nami.{{Qref|name=c988}}

Later, during the fight against the Worst Generation at the rooftop of the [[Skull Dome]], Big Mom became extremely angry with Zeus, calling him useless after he was trapped by Kid and Law inside a box, preventing him from saving Big Mom when they managed to throw her off the roof.{{Qref|name=c1010|chap=1010|page=6|ep=1027}} After he was freed from the box, Zeus immediately set off to find Big Mom, unaware of her fury towards him and that she had already replaced him with a new homie called [[Hera]].{{Qref|chap=1011|page=5|ep=1031}}

Upon finally reaching Big Mom, Zeus was heartbroken to see Hera alongside the other special Homies, which was only compounded when Linlin declared she no longer needed Zeus, and even went as far as to offer his life and soul fragment to his successor. This callous treatment led him to rebel against his creator in order to create an opening for the Straw Hat Pirates to escape.{{Qref|name=c1013}}

Despite what had happened, Zeus still cared for his former master when he briefly cried for her upon learning of her defeat to [[Trafalgar D. Water Law|Trafalgar Law]] and [[Eustass Kid]], before Nami reminded him that she is no longer his master.{{Qref|name=c1041}}

====Prometheus and Napoleon ====
Zeus' fellow special homies seem to get along together and fight well in sync with each other.{{Qref|name=c845}}{{Qref|name=c851}} However, when he was distracted and then used by [[Nami]], [[Prometheus]] was shown to treat Zeus harshly.{{Qref|name=c876|chap=876|page=17|ep=848|Zeus is scolded by Prometheus.}} When Zeus was trapped by Kid and Law inside a box, preventing him from saving Big Mom from falling off into the ocean, both Prometheus and Napoleon called Zeus useless and stated that he was always holding them back, convincing Big Mom to replace him with Hera.{{Qref|name=c1010}} Neither Napoleon nor Prometheus showed any regret at Zeus being disposed of by Big Mom and Hera.{{Qref|name=c1013}}

==Abilities and Powers==
Zeus is far more powerful than normal [[homies]], as he is made from a fragment of [[Charlotte Linlin|Big Mom]]'s very own soul. This gives the cloud a will strong enough to resist the soul projection of the [[Yomi Yomi no Mi]]'s user.{{Qref|name=c853}} However, he can still be harmed by the user's attacks, as shown when Brook unleashed a powerful attack that sliced him in half, though Zeus was able to survive due to his composition.{{Qref|name=c890}}

As a cloud, Zeus can fly, produce both normal and {{Nihongo|"sweet rain"|水あめ|Mizuame}},{{Qref|name=c845}} and attack with powerful bolts of lightning,{{Qref|name=c855|chap=855|page=4-7, 10, 12|ep=823|Zeus protects a sleeping Big Mom.}} strong enough to defeat [[Vinsmoke Judge]] in one hit.{{Qref|name=c871|chap=871|page=14|ep=842|Big Mom uses Thunder Bolt.}} When combining powers with [[Prometheus]], they can manipulate the weather to create incredibly vast and destructive thunderstorms.{{Qref|name=intro}}{{Qref|name=c845}} Like Prometheus, Zeus is mostly immune to physical attacks due to being an intangible cloud, even attacks imbued with [[Haki/Armament Haki|Armament Haki]], being simply able to recombine his body. However, unleashing massive discharges weakens Zeus, decreasing his size until he can recharge by consuming electricity. It has also been shown that electricity-based attacks work well against Zeus due to his composition as a thundercloud; if someone unleashes electrical energy that combines with his, Zeus can be forced to unwillingly discharge his electricity, up to the point of harming his master, Big Mom.{{Qref|name=c890}} Zeus' attacks being lightning-based also means certain characters can resist them without much issue, such as [[Monkey D. Luffy]], whose body is made of insulating [[Gomu Gomu no Mi|rubber]], and Brook, who has no flesh to be harmed by electricity to begin with.{{Qref|name=c1002|chap=1002|ep=1017|Big Mom and Kaidou vs. the Worst Generation.}}

[[File:Big Mom Flying on Zeus.png|thumb|210px|Big Mom flying on Zeus.]]

He can also expand and serve as a seat for Big Mom, being made of more dense and tangible material similar to [[Sea Clouds]].{{Qref|name=c853}} Zeus can also carry objects and people while flying, as seen when he transported Pudding and Sanji to the wedding venue{{Qref|chap=861|page=15|ep=831|Zeus carries Pudding and Sanji.}} and when he carried Big Mom to chase the Straw Hats, flying at incredible speeds, enough to catch up to the Straw Hats, who had a significant headstart, while carrying Big Mom.{{Qref|name=c873|chap=873|page=12|ep=844|Big Mom rides Zeus to chase the Straw Hats.}}

[[File:Zeus Becoming a Mace.png|thumb|left|210px|Zeus transforming into a mace as part of Nami's Clima-Tact.]]

After his soul was transferred to Nami's [[Art of Weather/Sorcery Clima-Tact/Grow Up|Sorcery Clima-Tact]], Zeus gained a wider breadth of abilities. He can manipulate the orange appendages on both ends and shape them as he pleases, having shown the ability to freely form them into weapons like a mace. This makes it similar to [[Napoleon]]'s ability to manipulate the weapon's shape they inhabit. He can also inhabit weather phenomena that Nami generates from the Clima-Tact, allowing him to perform lightning-based attacks like he is used to if Nami generates a cloud using him. Although Zeus claims that his soul cannot leave the Clima-Tact without Big Mom's [[Soru Soru no Mi|ability]],{{Qref|name=c1016}} he is seemingly able to exist in cloud form without being tethered to it.{{Qref|name=c1041}}{{Qref|name=c1050}} However, Zeus now gains new weaknesses in this form. The first is that he now has a solid form instead of an incorporeal cloud form, which means he can be killed should the Clima-Tact ever be broken. While he can move his consciousness to clouds and lightning generated by the Clima-Tact, his true body is still the Tact. The second would be a lack of mobility, as seen when Nami fought [[S-Shark]]. After the Clima-Tact was knocked out of Nami's hands, Zeus was unable to get back to her by himself.

