====Charlotte Linlin====
*{{Nihongo|'''Raitei'''|雷霆|Raitei|literally meaning "Thunderbolt"}}: Big Mom summons Zeus around her left hand, charging it with electricity, and then slams it down on her opponent, striking them both with her superhuman strength and a powerful bolt of lightning. It was first used against Vinsmoke Judge and was powerful enough to knock him out in one hit.{{Qref|name=c871}} This is called '''Thunder Bolt''' in the VIZ manga and Funimation adaptations.
*{{Nihongo|'''Indra'''|{{Ruby|威鼓|インドラ}}|Indora|literally meaning "Mighty Drum"}}: Big Mom makes Zeus shoot a lightning bolt at a distant enemy. It was first used against [[Killer]].{{Qref|name=c1002}} [[w:c:mythus:Indra|Indra]] is the deity of heavens, lightning, thunder, and storms in Hinduism.
[[File:Tenman Daijizai Tenjin.png|thumb|210px|Tenman Daijizai Tenjin]]
