==History==
===Past===
[[File:Linlin Begins Her Pirating Career.png|thumb|left|195x195px|Zeus and Prometheus aiding a young Linlin in her pirating activities.]]

Zeus was created by a young [[Charlotte Linlin]], and along with [[Prometheus]], became one of her main weapons as she began her pirating career several decades ago. One such activity was the three of them raiding a kingdom for sweets.{{Qref|chap=868|page=9|ep=838|Zeus and Prometheus are seen with a younger Linlin.}}

Around 44 years ago, Zeus was by Big Mom's side as she and the [[Rocks Pirates]] robbed treasure from the [[International Philanthropy Federation|Foot Colony]].{{Qref|name=c1157}} 38 years ago, during the [[God Valley Incident]], while retreating from [[Monkey D. Garp]] Linlin summoned Zeus and Prometheus for an attack on the Vice Admiral. Despite the resulting inferno, Garp remained practically unharmed.{{Qref|chap=1161|page=10-12|Zeus is present with Big Mom during the God Valley Incident.}} Following Kaidou's theft of her [[Uo Uo no Mi, Model: Seiryu|Devil Fruit]], Zeus carried Linlin to pursue him whilst he was in the middle of a scuffle involving [[Jaygarcia Saturn]] possessed by [[Imu]]. Linlin flew in on Zeus, attempting to kill Kaidou, however her attack missed and instead went into Imu.{{Qref|chap=1163|page=11-13|ep=}}{{-}}

===During the Timeskip===
When [[Urouge]] invaded [[Totto Land]] and defeated [[Charlotte Snack|Snack]], Big Mom had Zeus and Prometheus create a large thunderstorm to assist [[Charlotte Cracker|Cracker]] as he pursued and drove off Urouge.{{Qref|name=intro}}{{-}}

===Whole Cake Island Saga ===
====Whole Cake Island Arc====
Zeus danced with Big Mom alongside the other [[homies]] as she asked for a status report on the preparations for [[Sanji]] and [[Charlotte Pudding]]'s wedding.{{Qref|name=debut}} During Big Mom's rampage in [[Whole Cake Island#Sweet City|Sweet City]], Zeus told Prometheus that it was useless trying to talk to her during her tantrums, as she would not hear them.{{Qref|name=c829}}

[[File:Prometheus and Zeus Wreak Havoc.png|thumb|210px|Zeus and Prometheus create a storm.]]

When [[Monkey D. Luffy]] invaded Whole Cake Island and defeated Cracker, Zeus and Prometheus created a large storm of sweet rain as [[Big Mom Pirates|Big Mom's army]] attacked Luffy.{{Qref|name=c845}}

Zeus later returned to the Whole Cake Chateau, where he carried a [[Den Den Mushi]] on his back for Big Mom to speak through.{{Qref|chap=847|page=12|ep=813|Big Mom talk to a captive Luffy and Nami.}} After Luffy challenged Big Mom during the call, Zeus asked her if she would get mad, but she replied that it was of no importance as she was too happy. However, when Big Mom got angry upon hearing that someone had broken into the Room of Treasure, Zeus became fearful.{{Qref|name=c848}}

[[File:Brook vs. Big Mom.png|thumb|left|210px|Big Mom battles Brook with Zeus and Prometheus.]]

Big Mom broke into the Room of Treasure and summoned Zeus and Prometheus to help her battle [[Brook]], whom they easily overwhelmed.{{Qref|name=c851}} After Brook was defeated, Big Mom sat on Zeus as she caressed the Straw Hat.{{Qref|name=c853}} Later on, Zeus accompanied Big Mom and Pudding inside the Queen's Chamber, and the latter sat on the cloud while conversing with her mother about the upcoming wedding.{{Qref|chap=854|page=6-9|ep=822|Zeus serve as Pudding's seat.}}

Big Mom and her homies then went to bed, but as she slept, she spotted and swatted at a fly. Thinking there was an intruder in the room, Zeus, Prometheus, and [[Napoleon]] woke up and attacked the spot where Big Mom had swatted the fly before going back to sleep. Later, Zeus spotted [[Carrot]] approaching Big Mom and attacked her, thinking she was the fly.{{Qref|name=c855}}

On the morning of the wedding day, Big Mom was crying in grief when the skeleton she was carrying was not moving (not knowing that Brook was replaced). Zeus and Prometheus cheered her up by reminding her of the wedding.{{Qref|chap=859|page=16|ep=829|Zeus and Prometheus cheer up Big Mom.}} They later accompanied her to the wedding venue as the [[Tea Party]] began.{{Qref|chap=860|page=16-17|ep=830|Zeus is seen at the beginning of the tea party.}} Zeus and Prometheus celebrated during the tea party, and when the time came for a wedding ceremony to begin, Zeus transported Sanji and Pudding to the venue on a giant teacup.{{Qref|chap=861|page=14-17|ep=831|Zeus ushers the betrothed couple to the wedding.}}

When Luffy broke into the wedding venue, Big Mom summoned Zeus and Prometheus to her side in order to attack him. However, [[Charlotte Katakuri]] intercepted Luffy first.{{Qref|chap=863|page=12|ep=833|Big Mom plans to attack Luffy.}}

[[File:Big Mom Defeats Judge.png|thumb|210px|Zeus strikes down Judge.]]

Later as the Vinsmoke Family battled against the Big Mom Pirates in order to provide an opening for Luffy and Bege's groups to escape, Zeus was going to be used to finish off [[Vinsmoke Reiju|Reiju]] after Prometheus failed to kill her. However, Luffy's Gear 3 and Sanji's [[Black Leg Style/Diable Jambe|Diable Jamble]] countered Zeus at the last second.{{Qref|chap=870|page=16-17|ep=841|Luffy and Sanji stop Big Mom from attacking Reiju.}} [[Vinsmoke Judge]] then stepped in to fight Big Mom, and she had Zeus use Thunder Bolt to strike down Germa's king.{{Qref|name=c871}} However, the [[Tamatebako]] fell to the foot of the Chateau and exploded, causing the building to topple over. Big Mom fell off the venue, and Zeus cushioned her before she hit the ground.{{Qref|chap=872|page=15|ep=843|Zeus saves Big Mom from the fall.}}

[[File:Zeus Breeze Tempo.png|thumb|left|210px|Nami uses Zeus' power against Big Mom.]]

After a craving Big Mom was told by [[Charlotte Perospero|Perospero]] that the Straw Hats had her desired wedding cake, she summoned Zeus, who quickly flew her to the Straw Hats' location.{{Qref|name=c873}} After Big Mom launched her first attack on the Straw Hats, [[Nami]] released several [[Art of Weather/Sorcery Clima-Tact/Grow Up|thunderclouds]] in Zeus' direction, which caused him to veer off-course to eat them while dropping Big Mom to the ground. Zeus then caught up with the fleeing Kingbaum and asked Nami for more thunderclouds. Nami offered to feed him more if Zeus became her servant in return. This made Zeus start wondering if he should abandon Big Mom. When Big Mom ordered the tree homies of the Seducing Woods to stop the Straw Hats, Zeus noted on how angry Big Mom was.{{Qref|chap=874|page=3-13|ep=844|ep2=845|Big Mom chases after the Sanji Retrieval Team.}} Despite Big Mom's orders, Zeus continued to be coaxed on by Nami. However, he unwittingly ate her entire Weather Egg, causing him to balloon in size and cover the sky as he became stormy. Nami then used Zeus to strike Big Mom with a massive thunderbolt.{{Qref|name=c875}}

After Zeus returned to his normal size, Prometheus berated the cloud homie for his actions. Zeus apologized, saying he could not help it before commenting that he still thought Nami's clouds were delicious.{{Qref|name=c876}} After Big Mom left Whole Cake Island to continue pursuing the Straw Hats, Zeus was at the western coast, wondering why nobody was there.{{Qref|chap=879|page=8|ep=851|Zeus and Prometheus are separated from Big Mom.}}

[[File:Brook Bisects Zeus.png|thumb|210px|Zeus is bisected by Brook.]]

Later on, Zeus and Prometheus traveled over Totto Land's sea to reunite with Big Mom. They eventually returned to her, and they went to attack the [[Thousand Sunny]].{{Qref|chap=889|page=11, 14-17|ep=863|Zeus and Prometheus return to Big Mom's aid.}} As they attacked, [[Jinbe]] managed to knock Big Mom off the Sunny, but Zeus caught her. They headed back to the Sunny, and Zeus was presented with more thunderclouds by Nami. However, Zeus resisted the temptation and attacked her, but his attack hit Brook, who was immune to electricity. The skeleton sliced Zeus in half and Nami sent her thunderclouds in between Zeus' halves, causing him to discharge a massive amount of electricity that engulfed Big Mom. Zeus was greatly weakened and briefly knocked out, enabling Brook to bring him back to the Sunny. Nami then threatened Zeus, stating that she would kill him if he did not serve her.{{Qref|name=c890}}

====Levely Arc====
After the Straw Hats escaped from Totto Land, Zeus appeared out of Nami's Clima-Tact. When Sanji told the cloud homie that he was Nami's servant first, Zeus reminded Sanji that he lives inside the Clima-Tact.{{Qref|name=c903}}

===Wano Country Saga===
{{Non-Canon}}
====One Piece: Stampede====
He is summoned by Nami during the battle of the pirates in the [[Pirates Festival]] against the [[Marines]], electrocuting some Marines and pirates.{{Qref|movie=14}}
{{Non-Canon|end}}

====Wano Country Arc====
In Orochi Castle in [[Wano Country]], Nami and [[Shinobu]] broke into the banquet hall, and Nami had Zeus come out of her Clima-Tact. With Zeus charged with storm energy, Nami brought him down onto Wano's shogun [[Kurozumi Orochi]], unleashing a massive thunderbolt.{{Qref|name=c933}}

[[File:Big Mom Retrieves Zeus.png|thumb|left|210px|Big Mom regains Zeus.]]

On the day of the [[Fire Festival]], Zeus joined the Straw Hats on the Thousand Sunny as they entered the battle with the Beasts Pirates.{{Qref|name=c975}} When he was near Prometheus at Onigashima, it caused Nami's staff to react.{{Qref|chap=982|page=15|ep=989}} As Prometheus called Big Mom, Zeus fled with Nami and her group.{{Qref|chap=983|page=4|ep=991}} However, Big Mom was able to recapture Zeus and subdue Nami and Carrot.{{Qref|chap=985|page=12-13|ep=993}} After being brought to the Live Stage and later during the raid, Big Mom used her power over him to regain control and threatened to eliminate Zeus if he went too soft on Nami. Just as an angry Nami declared her friendship with Zeus over, Brook arrived and once again sliced Zeus in half with his sword.{{Qref|name=c988}} Big Mom was later driven out of the castle by Jinbe and Robin, and she then clashed with [[Polo Marco|Marco]]. When [[Carrot]] and [[Wanda]] arrived, Big Mom used Zeus to retreat from the area and go back to Kaidou's location.{{Qref|chap=995|page=7|ep=1009}}

[[File:Zeus Contained.png|thumb|210px|Zeus gets separated and trapped away from Big Mom.]]

When Big Mom joined Kaidou on the rooftop of the [[Skull Dome]], Zeus recharged to full strength by eating the lightning from the sky above Onigashima.{{Qref|chap=999|page=17-19|ep=1014}} During the confrontation against Luffy, [[Eustass Kid]], [[Killer]], [[Trafalgar D. Water Law|Trafalgar Law]], and [[Roronoa Zoro]], Zeus carried Big Mom and delivered devastating lightning attacks on the members of the [[Worst Generation]].{{Qref|chap=1001|page=15-17|ep=1017}} However, during the fight, Zeus was [[Ope Ope no Mi|trapped inside]] [[Jiki Jiki no Mi|a metal box]] by Kid and Law, preventing him from saving Big Mom when she was pushed off the rooftop as he desperately attempted to break out.{{Qref|chap=1009|page=15-19|ep=1026}}{{Qref|chap=1010|page=2|ep=1027}} Later, when Big Mom's attack on Kid freed Zeus from the metal box, he immediately set out to look for and save Big Mom, but was teleported downstairs by Law's ability.{{Qref|name=c1011|chap=1011|page=5, 19|ep=1031}} Crying, Zeus yelled that he would help Big Mom. When Sanji asked the cloud about Nami, Zeus was shocked and flew away faster.{{Qref|chap=1012|page=8|ep=1033}}

[[File:Big Mom Drains Zeus' Soul.png|thumb|left|210px|Zeus has his soul extracted out by Big Mom.]]

Zeus eventually found Big Mom after she attacked [[Page One]] inside the Skull Dome.{{Qref|name=c1011}} Zeus approached her, seeing a new thundercloud homie named [[Hera]] and believing that she was an addition to their troupe. However, Big Mom informed him that Hera was his replacement and that his services would no longer be needed, and proceeded to have Hera eat Zeus to consume his soul. Zeus then saw Nami running nearby and called out to her, and even though she did not forgive him, he decided to make it up to her by attacking Big Mom. However, Big Mom easily grabbed him and sucked out much of his soul, rendering him weak enough for Hera to eat without resistance. Nami released some black lightning balls to power Zeus up, but he was unable to consume them as Hera chomped down on him and Nami's Clima-Tact.{{Qref|chap=1013|page=7-13|ep=1033|ep2=1034}}

[[File:Zeus Merges With the Sorcery Clima-Tact.png|thumb|210px|Zeus merges with Nami's Sorcery Clima-Tact.]]

However, due to Zeus' soul being out of his body, it managed to end up being absorbed into the Clima-Tact rather than Hera. Upon fully manifesting in the weapon, Zeus greeted Nami and explained how he got there. The Tobiroppo [[Ulti]] then arrived, and as Nami tried to attack her with the Clima-Tact, Zeus shifted its appendage into a mace to strike Ulti in the head. Nami then hatched a stormcloud from a Weather Egg, and to her surprise Zeus inhabited the cloud as well. Nami then charged Zeus up to attack Ulti with '''Raitei''', and although Ulti jumped out of the attack's path, Zeus changed direction and flew into her, engulfing her in lightning and knocking her unconscious.{{Qref|name=c1016}} Zeus then appeared in cloud form and though Nami had rejected his offer to becoming her servant again, she made a better offer of becoming her partner and Zeus, happy at this news, immediately attacked several Beasts Pirates members.{{Qref|name=c1018}}

After hearing that Big Mom was defeated by Eustass Kid and Trafalgar Law, Zeus expressed sadness until Nami reprehended him.{{Qref|name=c1041}} When the entire [[Skull Dome]] was starting to get engulfed in massive flames, Chopper asked whether Zeus could use rain to put out the fire. However, Zeus responded that the fire was so great that he would only get burned himself.{{Qref|chap=1046|page=7|ep=1073}} He was later floating next to Nami and Tama when the victory of the [[Ninja-Pirate-Mink-Samurai Alliance|alliance]] was announced.{{Qref|name=c1050}}

Later, during the post-raid festival, Zeus was floating above Nami and Tama, hungrily staring at Nami's cotton candy.{{Qref|chap=1053|page=3|ep=1082}}

{{Non-Canon}}
====One Piece Film: Red====
Zeus is summoned by Nami while trapped in the [[Uta World]] to help her fight against temple sentries and the Straw Hats search for information in a temple. He then is summoned again in the fight against [[Tot Musica]].{{Qref|movie=15}}
{{Non-Canon|end}}

===Final Saga===
====Egghead Arc====
After the Straw Hats reach [[Egghead]], Nami, Usopp, Franky, Robin, and Sanji follow [[Vegapunk/Lilith|Lilith]] into Vegapunk's lab, but she leaves and the group are introduced to [[Vegapunk/Edison|Edison]], who leads them into a fight against the [[Seraphim]] [[S-Shark]]. As they battle the [[Pacifista]], Nami starts to pull out Zeus, put then stops, prompting Zeus inside the Clima-tact to ask Nami what is wrong, and Nami states that she can't bring herself to attack a child, prompting her to be saved by Sanji when S-Shark grabs her by the neck.{{Qref|name=c1065|chap=1065}} 

Later, after Luffy and the remaining Straw Hats stop the Seraphim and [[CP0]] from destroying the entire lab, and everyone regroups and plan to take the Vegapunks and even [[Stussy]] with them, Egghead's security and defenses become unresponsive, preventing them from leaving, and the main [[Vegapunk]] and [[Jewelry Bonney]] are also missing as well. As everyone splits into groups to find them, an unknown attack on [[Vegapunk/Pythagoras|Pythagoras]] happens and the surveillance system goes out, with the groups later coming under attack themselves by the Seraphim, with Nami's group attacked once again by S-Shark. 

[[File:Saturn Attacks Robin.png|thumb|left|210px|Zeus helps protect Robin from Saturn.]]

As S-Shark knocked Brook’s head off of his body and heavily damaged Edison, Nami decided to fight back against the Seraphim, even if it was a child who looked like Jinbe. She reluctantly summoned Zeus, who told her not think about fighting him and to close her eyes while he attacked S-Shark. Nami apologized profusely for having to harm S-Shark, especially when it seemed to actually wound him. However, S-Shark was able to make a quick recovery, and put Nami back in his sightlines, to Zeus' horror. Before Nami could be harmed, however, Sanji made an appearance, and promised to kill S-Shark for daring to hurt her.{{Qref|name=c1077|chap=1077|ep=1110}} Later on, Zeus was summoned by Nami in his mace form to protect [[Nico Robin|Robin]] from [[Jaygarcia Saturn]].{{Qref|chap=1113|page=16-17|ep=1147}}

====Elbaph Arc====
When Nami had somehow made it inside [[Land of Gods#Bigstein Castle|Bigstein Castle]], she summoned Zeus to fight off the Stingmore that were attacking her. As she was being chased by the [[Needle God]] and found Usopp caught by [[Iscat]], she had Zeus electrocute the Needle God, which fell onto Iscat, electrocuting the giant cat as well. However, Iscat remained conscious and chased the pirates.{{Qref|chap=1127|page=3, 6-7|ep=1157}}

[[File:Road Struck Down.png|thumb|210px|Zeus strikes down the "Sun God".]]

Later, while being pursued by the [[Road|Sun God]], Nami called Zeus out once more and used him to strike down their pursuer, out of revenge for placing them into the Land of Gods.{{Qref|chap=1129|page=15|ep=1159}} Sometime later, after finally making it to [[Elbaph]]'s Sun World, Nami summoned Zeus again to shock [[Road]], the same Giant who had her and her friends imprisoned in the [[Land of Gods]] into becoming her new servant. She also had him assist her, Luffy, and Zoro at getting into [[Aurust Castle]], mainly so she could loot the castle of its treasure. When Road happily claimed that he was Nami's servant and a fellow navigator, Nami told him off, leading Zeus to tell Road about the hierarchy of Nami's servants, with Zeus being at the top, Sanji being second, and now Road in third.{{Qref|name=c1136}}

[[File:Thunder Shark Tempo.png|thumb|left|210px|Zeus uses ''Thunder Shark Tempo''.]]

Much later, after embarking a svarr with [[Colon]], with the goal of hunting down the [[Knights of God]] on Elbaph, Zeus was brought out as [[Gunko]] confronted the Straw Hats. Nami had Zeus use [[Art of Weather/Sorcery Clima-Tact/Zeus#Battle Uses|Thunder Shark Tempo]], however Gunko was able to use her [[Aro Aro no Mi|devil fruit]] to redirect him back at Nami. Zeus burst into tears as he was forced to hit what he thought was Nami, but was instantly relieved to find that Brook had stepped into her place. Unfortunately for Zeus, his allies were unable to stop Gunko, and he was subsequently thrown overboard with Nami.{{Qref|chap=1146|page=2-14|ep=1176}}

The Straw Hats were collected and tied up, making them temporary hostages until the World Government had completed its plans on Elbaph. Said plans involved taking ten of Elbaph's children hostage, with the only way to save them being to burn down the [[Walrus School]] and [[Owl Library]], and to join the World Government. Much later, these plans unraveled when the children were rescued by the efforts of Luffy and Loki, with the other Straw Hats also being freed. However, Elbaph's educational facilities continued to burn, forcing them to act. Nami had Zeus use water he had collected to rain on the fires, but [[Rimoshifu Killingham|Killingham]], one of the Knights of God, was still present. He had a Lindwyrm MMA simply eat Zeus, leaving him trapped inside the creature's stomach. Fortunately for Zeus, the combined efforts of Franky and Jinbe took down the MMA holding him, releasing him, while a piece of Vegapunk's technology sent by Lilith put out the fires.{{Qref|chap=1176|page=4-13|ep=}}

Zeus thanked his crewmates afterward as Nami fed him more lightning balls.{{Qref|chap=1177|page=9-10|ep=}} The two soon went back to extinguishing fires around the Sun World.{{Qref|chap=1178|page=8-9|ep=}}

