'''Tama''' is a friendly pet [[sphinx]] from [[Edward Newgate|Whitebeard]]'s home island [[Sphinx (Location)|Sphinx]]. It is owned by [[Oide]].{{Qref|name=debut}}

==Appearance==
As a sphinx, Tama resembles a lion with a humanoid face, sharp fangs, feathers along its back and arms, and a bushy mane which has a tuft of hair at the top that stands-up right. Unlike the sphinx in [[Impel Down]], Tama is notably smaller, only being about three times larger than [[Polo Marco|Marco]].{{Qref|name=debut}}

==Personality==
Tama seems to be a friendly creature who loves its owner, Oide.{{Qref|name=debut}}

==Abilities and Powers==
Being a sphinx, along with its large size, might indicate that it is quite strong; however, it is never seen fighting. It also does not seem to be capable of mimicking speech yet. Normally it seems to be capable of flight with its wings; however, it is injured and needs to rest before it can fly again.{{Qref|name=debut}}

==History==
===Wano Country Saga===
====Wano Country Arc====
In [[Edward Newgate|Whitebeard]]'s homeland, Tama was being healed by [[Polo Marco|Marco]] after it suffered several injuries. After Marco tended to its wounds, Oide thanked the doctor and they went on their way.{{Qref|name=debut}}

==Trivia==
*''Tama'' means "ball" in Japanese and is commonly used as a name for cats in Japan.

